22_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CJNgVbgk_NkQ7kNvwHpXOyq&_nc_oc=AdrIUBwTnI-GpJSkHGBDGxJL9vvee_1cjvmxkQRSmXAsNUN10f4hkJY1CLr6sJYlucg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-b9hQ31vuMQoEyUKjCtvBmDniiK77SVjBYmOr-B4LRMg&oe=6A3178CE"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n\n\n     \n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_cat